CORE | Oct 25–Oct 31, 2026 | Smiley Rate 76.09% (+0.34 pp vs prior period), 3.91 pp below target (80.00% target). 9,462 Smileys / 12,435 responses.


Insight
Smiley Rate changed +0.34 pp, from 75.75% in Oct 18–Oct 24, 2026 (12,807 responses) to 76.09% in Oct 25–Oct 31, 2026 (12,435 responses). Within-squad rates contributed +0.42 pp, and the shift in response mix contributed -0.08 pp. Ramped (b. 6+ Months) (Ramp) recorded a +1.44 pp Smiley Rate change, from 76.04% to 77.48%, on 7,730 prior and 7,522 current responses and accounted for +0.87 pp of the CORE rate change. Finances (Level One) contributed +1.23 pp to the group’s rate change. In Finances, Resolution Recap moved from 87.96% to 89.55% across 1,686 to 1,723 scored checks.
Top Challenges
Ramping (a. 0-6 Months) (Ramp) recorded a -1.31 pp Smiley Rate change, from 75.30% to 73.99%, on 5,076 prior and 4,909 current responses and accounted for -0.52 pp of the CORE rate change. The group’s Smiley count was 3,822 in Oct 18–Oct 24, 2026 and 3,632 in Oct 25–Oct 31, 2026. The group finished 6.01 pp below target. Finances (Level One) contributed -0.47 pp to the group’s rate change. In Finances, Context Gathering moved from 94.40% to 92.37% across 1,358 to 1,363 scored checks.
